  "solution": "**Given:- **\n\n {28 over 21} × {96 over 4} div {125 over 5} × {42 over 192} + {297 over 125} × {875 over 3} div {99 over 4} × {6 over 25} \n\n**Concept used:- \n\n ** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/47485e25d1b30c57dc271863db8b99be0c8e209069b2596cc885911d898a8a78.png] \n\n**Calculation:-**\n\n⇒ {28 over 21} × {96 over 4} div {125 over 5} × {42 over 192} + {297 over 125} × {875 over 3} div {99 over 4} × {6 over 25} \n\n⇒ (28/21) × (96/4) × (5/125) × (42/192) + (297/125) × (875/3) × (4/99) × (6/25) \n\n⇒ (7/25) + (7 × 24)/25 \n\n⇒ (7/25)× [1 + 24] \n\n \n\n⇒ 7 \n\n**∴ The required answer is__ 7__.**\n89:T75",
